    ('05', '/projects/shikai/Shikai Collection/DriveBots/8781659B-98CA-4781-9C81-B1F185085D6E.png', 'A 3D-rendered digital image of a humanoid combat mech inspired by a car brand, in a heroic standing pose on a white background. The mech has a realistically integrated, miniature version of the car on its head (Megas XLR style). Armor style reflects the brand''s design language with appropriate color palette, iconic brand logo on chest, and glowing accent lights. Include dynamic details like exhaust pipes, wheel motifs, or electric energy effects. SERIES: DRIVEBOTS.', 0);
